@startuml
title 外卖点餐与配送系统：订单付款与支付结果
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
autonumber

boundary "Customer UI" as CustomerUI
participant "Order" as Order
participant "Mock Payment" as Payment
participant "Scheduled Jobs" as Scheduler
participant "Inventory" as Inventory
participant "Cancellation, Refund and Dispute" as Cancellation
participant "Data Access" as DataAccess
database "Persistent Storage" as Storage
participant "Notification" as Notification
participant "Audit Log" as Audit

CustomerUI -> Order : 对待付款订单发起模拟支付
Order -> Payment : 以唯一付款请求ID提交付款
Payment -> DataAccess : 保存付款请求与处理状态
DataAccess -> Storage : 持久化付款记录

alt 付款结果未返回
  Payment --> Order : 支付结果确认中
  Order --> CustomerUI : 显示确认中，禁止重复发起扣款
  Scheduler -> Order : 下单满10分钟仍未确认付款
  Order -> DataAccess : 核验最新状态并持久化已取消
  DataAccess -> Storage : 保存取消状态
  Order -> Inventory : 按取消规则恢复一次库存
  Payment -> Order : 超时取消后到达付款成功结果
  Order -> DataAccess : 核验请求ID及已取消状态
  DataAccess -> Storage : 记录迟到成功且只处理一次
  Order -> Cancellation : 对原付款发起一次全额退款
  Cancellation -> Payment : 模拟退款原付款账户
  Order -> Notification : 通知取消及退款进度
  Order -> Audit : 记录超时、迟到结果和退款
else 期限内付款成功
  Payment --> Order : 唯一成功结果
  Order -> DataAccess : 核验当前状态并更新为待商家接单
  DataAccess -> Storage : 保存状态及付款结果
  Order -> Notification : 通知顾客和商家付款成功
  Order --> CustomerUI : 显示待商家接单
else 期限内付款失败
  Payment --> Order : 失败原因
  Order --> CustomerUI : 保持待付款，显示原因和重试入口
end
@enduml
